{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6074","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6074/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6074/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6074/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6074","id":833605185,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU4MzM2MDUxODU=","number":6074,"title":"LegacyRow breaks column names used by abc.Sequence ('index', 'count')","user":{"login":"dwhswenson","id":8178546,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNzg1NDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8178546?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwhswenson","html_url":"https://github.com/dwhswenson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwhswenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwhswenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwhswenson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwhswenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwhswenson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwhswenson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwhswenson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwhswenson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwhswenson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1141269142,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxMjY5MTQy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":1141275752,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxMjc1NzUy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/labels/engine","name":"engine","color":"B04040","default":false,"description":"engines, connections, transactions, isolation levels, execution options"},{"id":1154021464,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTU0MDIxNDY0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":"something worked and was broken by a change"},{"id":1959689852,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTU5Njg5ODUy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/labels/great%20mcve","name":"great mcve","color":"dcf972","default":false,"description":"An issue with a great mcve"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestones/89","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestone/89","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestones/89/labels","id":4398560,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNDM5ODU2MA==","number":89,"title":"1.4.x","description":null,"creator":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":522,"state":"open","created_at":"2019-06-11T16:37:26Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T15:15:28Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2021-03-17T10:06:56Z","updated_at":"2021-03-17T17:03:21Z","closed_at":"2021-03-17T17:02:40Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\n\r\n`LegacyRow` inherits from `Row` which inherits from `abc.Sequence`. `abc.Sequence` has a method `index`. This means that if a table has a column named `'index'`, that cannot be accessed via `getattr`. Therefore 1.4 breaks behavior that worked in 1.3.\r\n\r\nThis is also true for columns named `'count'`.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n\r\nAttribute-based access should work for columns named `'index'` or `'count'`.\r\n\r\n**Workaround**\r\n\r\nIt works if I use `__getitem__`-based access, i.e., `result['index']`.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n\r\n```py\r\nimport sqlalchemy\r\nengine = sqlalchemy.create_engine('sqlite:///:memory:')\r\nmetadata = sqlalchemy.MetaData(bind=engine)\r\n\r\nfingers = ['thumb', 'index', 'middle', 'ring', 'pinky']\r\ncolumns = [\r\n    sqlalchemy.Column(finger, sqlalchemy.Integer)\r\n    for finger in fingers\r\n]\r\ntable = sqlalchemy.Table('hand', metadata, *columns)\r\nmetadata.create_all(engine)\r\n\r\nvalues = {'thumb': 3, 'index': 1, 'middle': 4, 'ring': 1, 'pinky': 5}\r\n\r\nwith engine.connect() as conn:\r\n    conn.execute(table.insert([values]))\r\n\r\nwith engine.connect() as conn:\r\n    select_all = conn.execute(table.select())\r\n    result = select_all.fetchone()\r\n    select_all.close()     \r\n\r\nprint(\" \".join([f\"{finger}={getattr(result, finger)}\" for finger in fingers]))\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn 1.3:\r\n\r\n```\r\nthumb=3 index=1 middle=4 ring=1 pinky=5\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn 1.4:\r\n\r\n```\r\nthumb=3 index=<bound method Sequence.index of (3, 1, 4, 1, 5)> middle=4 ring=1 pinky=5\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Versions.**\r\n - OS: macOS 10.15.7\r\n - Python: 3.7.3\r\n - SQLAlchemy: 1.3.6/1.4.0","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6074/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6074/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}